@{ ViewData["Title"] = "引擎開發與測試入口"; }

<section class="login-shell">
    <div class="hero-panel">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span></span> ENGINE DEVELOPMENT &amp; EVIDENCE</div>
        <h1>讓每一次改善，<br /><em>都能在遊戲畫面中看見。</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">Aevrynd 專注原生 2.5D／3D 遊戲引擎。主機統籌開發與驗收，台中、桃園按需提供測試運算資源。近期目標：以相同鏡頭比較，將完整 Demo 視覺由 34／100 提升至至少 70／100；v1.4 尚未發布。</p>

        <div class="network-card" aria-label="三台運算節點概況">
            <div class="network-head">
                <div><span class="micro-label">RESOURCE TOPOLOGY</span><strong>三台主機分工示意</strong></div>
                <span class="network-live"><i></i> 架構示意</span>
            </div>
            <div class="node-flow" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span></div>
            <div class="node-grid">
                <article class="node-card node-primary">
                    <div class="node-icon"><span></span></div>
                    <div><small>CORE / CODEX</small><strong>主電腦</strong></div>
                    <i class="node-status"></i>
                </article>
                <article class="node-card">
                    <div class="node-icon node-icon-secondary"><span></span></div>
                    <div><small>ON-DEMAND TESTING</small><strong>台中測試資源</strong></div>
                    <i class="node-status"></i>
                </article>
                <article class="node-card">
                    <div class="node-icon node-icon-tertiary"><span></span></div>
                    <div><small>ON-DEMAND TESTING</small><strong>桃園測試資源</strong></div>
                    <i class="node-status"></i>
                </article>
            </div>
            <div class="network-foot"><span>非即時在線狀態；不啟動副機 AI 輪詢</span><span>3 COMPUTE NODES</span></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="auth-panel" aria-labelledby="login-title">
        <div class="auth-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="auth-heading">
            <span class="auth-symbol" aria-hidden="true"><span></span></span>
            <div><p>SECURE ACCESS</p><h2 id="login-title">登入控制中心</h2></div>
        </div>
        <p class="auth-intro">公開開發展示不需登入。已授權信箱可取得一次性驗證碼（OTP），查看主機與工作紀錄；遠端操作僅限管理者及既有額外授權。</p>

        <form id="loginForm" class="auth-form">
            <div class="field-group">
                <label for="email">電子信箱</label>
                <div class="input-wrap">
                    <span class="input-icon" aria-hidden="true">@@</span>
                    <input id="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" placeholder="name@example.com" />
                </div>
            </div>
            <button id="sendButton" class="button button-primary" type="button">
                <span>傳送驗證碼</span><i aria-hidden="true">→</i>
            </button>

            <div id="verifyBox" class="verify-box" hidden>
                <div class="divider"><span>輸入郵件中的代碼</span></div>
                <div class="field-group">
                    <label for="code">8 位英數驗證碼</label>
                    <div class="input-wrap">
                        <span class="input-icon input-icon-key" aria-hidden="true">◆</span>
                        <input id="code" class="code-input" minlength="8" maxlength="8" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9]{8}" required autocomplete="one-time-code" autocapitalize="characters" placeholder="••••••••" />
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button class="button button-secondary" type="submit"><span>驗證並登入</span><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></button>
            </div>

            <p id="status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
            <div class="security-note"><span aria-hidden="true">◇</span><p><strong>一次性安全驗證</strong><small>驗證碼 10 分鐘內有效，使用後立即失效。</small></p></div>
        </form>
    </aside>
</section>
